WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.294 --> 00:00:04.423
One of my next-door neighbors
is a 90-year-old man

00:00:04.549 --> 00:00:06.676
suffering from Alzheimer's.

00:00:08.052 --> 00:00:11.639
And every single morning at 9 a.m.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:17.270
he knocks on my door, and he asks me
if I have seen his wife.

00:00:18.646 --> 00:00:19.480
Which means...

00:00:20.523 --> 00:00:23.484
that every single morning at 9 a.m.

00:00:24.152 --> 00:00:28.823
I have to explain to a 90-year-old man
suffering from Alzheimer's

00:00:29.115 --> 00:00:33.161
that his wife has been dead&nbsp;
for quite some time.

00:00:34.036 --> 00:00:35.830
Now, I have thought about moving.

00:00:37.415 --> 00:00:40.543
I have thought about just not answering
my door in the morning,

00:00:41.127 --> 00:00:42.170
but to be honest,

00:00:43.171 --> 00:00:44.088
it's worth it

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:47.383
just to see the smile on his face.

00:00:47.466 --> 00:00:51.859
[laughter and applause]

